{"3813890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Codex Lost 2", "steam_appid": 3813890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813890/extras/079cdcb5f95933d1267bae34808fc52c.poster.avif?t=1769762685\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813890/extras/079cdcb5f95933d1267bae34808fc52c.webm?t=1769762685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813890/extras/079cdcb5f95933d1267bae34808fc52c.mp4?t=1769762685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813890/extras/ace01f4390810d01aebbbdfe9a5ea563.avif?t=1769762685\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813890/extras_big/ace01f4390810d01aebbbdfe9a5ea563.webp?t=1769762685 width=1560 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of years have passed since last the sun rose. Under its dissipating light, sinking ever deeper into the abyss, stands a single cathedral - the final testament to a bygone age. Only the Orillion Maille - the holy tome - can reunite the old powers and reverse the end of days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heretic, sinner, accursed soul - Heed the call and haul yourself up from the grave. Reclaim the codex lost and stand alone against certain undeath!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813890/extras/9b2967b5722ce5b3f6d18bf2ccf68c1e.poster.avif?t=1769762685\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813890/extras/9b2967b5722ce5b3f6d18bf2ccf68c1e.webm?t=1769762685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813890/extras/9b2967b5722ce5b3f6d18bf2ccf68c1e.mp4?t=1769762685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813890/extras/6932df60c180577cbb512ea66fd0f881.avif?t=1769762685\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813890/extras_big/6932df60c180577cbb512ea66fd0f881.webp?t=1769762685 width=1560 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A diverse arsenal of magical weapons, ancient armors, staves, spells, and curious relics. Craft the playstyle that fits your soul with a stat-driven progression system, whether it be cunning spell-slinger, ironclad battlemage, or desperate madman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813890/extras/bb62fb7eecc0472010da6251e1586606.poster.avif?t=1769762685\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813890/extras/bb62fb7eecc0472010da6251e1586606.webm?t=1769762685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813890/extras/bb62fb7eecc0472010da6251e1586606.mp4?t=1769762685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813890/extras/d2e05a6ce35b5597601ad7c5d4190bfe.avif?t=176976268